      },
      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "optical",
        "summary": "UV–vis absorption in CH2Cl2 shows high-energy band at 260 nm (intra-ligand π→π* of L− and acac−) and a broad band between 390 and 410 nm assigned to coordination of the Schiff base to Ln(III). NIR luminescence is not reported for this Lu analogue.",
