      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "optical",
        "summary": "Solid-state NIR luminescence of Er3+ is observed. Excitation monitoring 1538 nm shows a ligand-centered band (330–360 nm, max 350 nm) and an Er3+ f–f band near 480 nm (4I15/2 → 4F7/2). Ligand excitation at 350 nm gives emission from 1475–1650 nm with maximum at 1535 nm (4I13/2 → 4I15/2), indicating energy transfer from ligand triplet states to Er3+. The complex can also be excited at the Er3+ characteristic wavelength 976 nm. UV–vis in CH2Cl2 matches the other acac analogues.",
        "measurements": [
